    "description": {
      "value": "<p data-start=\"4355\" data-end=\"4369\"><em data-start=\"4355\" data-end=\"4369\">(10th Level)</em></p><p data-start=\"4371\" data-end=\"4412\"><em data-start=\"4371\" data-end=\"4412\">\u201cYou can\u2019t delete what I\u2019ve backed up.\u201d</em></p><p data-start=\"4414\" data-end=\"4512\">If a Precedent would be erased, overwritten, or forgotten, it instead becomes a <strong data-start=\"4494\" data-end=\"4511\">Latent Record</strong>.</p><p data-start=\"4514\" data-end=\"4529\">Latent Records:</p><ul data-start=\"4530\" data-end=\"4639\"><li data-start=\"4530\" data-end=\"4551\"><p data-start=\"4532\" data-end=\"4551\">Persist invisibly</p></li><li data-start=\"4552\" data-end=\"4600\"><p data-start=\"4554\" data-end=\"4600\">May be reactivated later at reduced strength</p></li><li data-start=\"4601\" data-end=\"4639\"><p data-start=\"4603\" data-end=\"4639\">Represent buried truth resurfacing</p></li></ul><h3 data-start=\"4641\" data-end=\"4649\">Cost</h3><p data-start=\"4650\" data-end=\"4719\">No Surge required to preserve. Reactivation may require 1 die.</p><h3 data-start=\"4721\" data-end=\"4733\">Pushback</h3><p data-start=\"4734\" data-end=\"4792\">Too many Latent Records can destabilize narrative clarity.</p><p><em>Recosted 2026-08-23: this ability's earlier economy (Civic Charge / Strain / Resonance / Leverage / Administrative Pressure) is retired \u2014 everything now runs on Surge, Clarity, Noise, and the misfire ladder. The ability dialog's cost line is the truth; ledgers named here are narrative, GM-adjudicated, never a tracked pool.</em></p>",
